e_name": "Paris Bright Oculus Store.png", "id": "220059216432030", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375083_220059219765363_5619007595863505849_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UUQTYjo-Ak8Q7kNvwFKIqjF&_nc_oc=AdoTBS7JNBlR6kahwaSCgr7SJF1jFT8DFJEieKMpWC1UfWTYGorDgohE3Bki1wjeci4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-B6MtjWpAp3mgZ2OTRD9DuKrZefV339C8agApkbDM_3w&oe=6A468FEA"}, {"file_name": "3 Point Winner Screen Oculus Store.png", "id": "1095687000936315", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575347_1095687004269648_6352501114012345669_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s_wCrGT7l4IQ7kNvwFHwjSQ&_nc_oc=AdoZLshtnKMymym6j845hxS-4hs5fzchnUa664Voo6NV4q2z2xBzVCr2ZqqDrLRQUZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9fAeBprh9FJHcXiP2Qu_djCNY0hQLzglkDm0steqnvbw&oe=6A468EB5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pickup Basketball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pickup Basketball VR is a multiplayer VR game that lets up to 4 players play in various game modes including 1v1, 2v2, Horse and 3-point contest. Pickup Basketball VR allows players to compete online with or against friends and players from across the world.\n\nThis basketball game is an immersive sports gaming experience like never-before utilizing the technology of VR.\n\nPickup Basketball VR utilizes unique technology in allowing  for a never-before experienced simulation of basketball featuring:\n\n- Realistic controls that involve dribbling, shooting, passing that brings you the feel of a true basketball game\n\n- Multiplayer mode where you can play other players online and test your skills in full play pick up games\n\n- Different court options including playground, gym, skyrise and more.\n\n- Customize your player avatar with a variety of options including face, skin tone, hair, jersey and other accessories", "short_description": "Pi